  "totalBlocks": 30,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4083c05e8d5d67d8",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版：将 Claude 连接到 Hugging Face Spaces 后，使用最先进的 AI 模型生成细节丰富的图片变得前所未有地容易。本文将说明如何实现这一点及其原因，并介绍近期推出的模型，这些模型擅长生成自然图像或包含文字的图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46d3e5f411af077d",
      "translationZh": "2025 年 10 月更新：随着 Anthropic 的连接器目录政策更新，你需要使用“添加自定义连接器”选项，并将远程 MCP 服务器 URL 设置为 https://huggingface.co/mcp?login，才能在 Claude 中使用图像生成及其他 Gradio Spaces。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7125d2e6ee168ef4",
      "translationZh": "图像生成模型的最新进展提升了它们生成逼真图像并融入高质量文字的能力。将这些模型直接连接到 Claude，使用起来就比以往任何时候都更容易。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b34f7b5b88a8189",
      "translationZh": "以这种方式生成图片的优势包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4065931997d5f06",
      "translationZh": "AI 可以协助构建详细的提示词，从而有可能提高生成图像的质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2700698232d01d0",
      "translationZh": "AI 可以“看到”生成的图像，然后帮助你反复改进设计和技巧，以获得完美的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc8508ea582947e1",
      "translationZh": "你可以轻松换用最新的模型，或最适合你需求的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4663f1e1bd76b7c",
      "translationZh": "首先，创建一个免费的 Hugging Face 账户，然后在 Claude 聊天输入框的“搜索和工具”菜单中将其连接到 Hugging Face。下面的视频展示了所需的具体步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b59aea678dc50a57",
      "translationZh": "将 Claude 连接到 Hugging Face",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adb6852b1f17c3a9",
      "translationZh": "在后台，Claude 现在已配置为使用 Hugging Face MCP Server 提供的工具，从而无缝扩展其能力。其中包括运行在我们由创新的 ZeroGPU 驱动的 Spaces 上的最新 AI 应用。你的 Hugging Face 账户提供免费额度，可用于使用这些强大的大型模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "549d234fc90ce218",
      "translationZh": "将 Claude 连接到 Hugging Face 后，我们将展示如何配置可供 Claude 使用的图像生成工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f48a647ca88bdf69",
      "translationZh": "使用 Flux.1 Krea Dev 生成自然的图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf4ca543f6ce270d",
      "translationZh": "FLUX.1 Krea [dev] 旨在消除生成图像中常见的、一眼就能看出的“AI 感”，例如塑料般的皮肤、过度饱和的色彩或过于平滑的纹理。如果你希望图像看起来像是由专业摄影师拍摄的，而不是由计算机生成的，Krea 能够呈现其他 AI 模型难以实现的逼真纹理、自然光照和真实美感。你可以在他们的博客上进一步了解他们是如何做到这一点的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5bb1a69436d01b5",
      "translationZh": "Krea 图像生成器的示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5771e22e3298d5c0",
      "translationZh": "要在 Claude 中使用 Krea，请前往 huggingface.co/mcp/settings，将 mcp-tools/FLUX.1-Krea-dev 添加到你的“Spaces 工具”中。只需这样操作，就能让 Claude 生成精美、逼真的图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3107161b1c146735",
      "translationZh": "在 MCP 设置中添加一个 Space",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c0e370b1763faf8",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以在 Claude 中尝试这样的提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c86b5665b133db3e",
      "translationZh": "“使用 Krea 创建一张图片，描绘一个生机勃勃的花园，园中有一座维多利亚式房屋”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6080e745fce28b6d",
      "translationZh": "以开始生成图片。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "872f8dc14ee79155",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-Image 是一款强大的 AI 图像生成器，擅长遵循提示词并准确渲染文字，因此非常适合设计对文字质量有要求的海报、标牌、信息图和营销材料。你可以阅读他们的博客文章，进一步了解 Qwen-Image 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99bd3fda15eeedfd",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-Image 生成器的示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c03afd06752976e",
      "translationZh": "要使用 Qwen-Image，请在 MCP Servers 设置页面中添加 mcp-tools/qwen-image，然后检查它是否已在 Claude 中启用，即可开始使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b6aaf70723c9c89",
      "translationZh": "Qwen-Image 配备了一个提示词增强器，可帮助编写适合它的详细提示词。要试用它，请从提示词菜单中选择“Qwen Prompt Enhancer”，输入你的想法，然后提交给 Claude。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "507c00d1ac919e01",
      "translationZh": "在 Claude 中使用 Qwen Prompt Enhancer",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d634116524c297a2",
      "translationZh": "你甚至可以同时启用 Krea 和 Qwen-Image，并让 Claude 同时使用两者，以便比较结果。例如：“使用 Krea 和 Qwen 生成一个街景，墙上喷有‘Hugging Face’涂鸦。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4887573553461592",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 涂鸦街景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c6121ce73618a46",
      "translationZh": "将 Claude 连接到 Hugging Face Spaces，就能像点击按钮一样轻松地使用前沿模型，即使在新模型发布当天也是如此。访问 https://huggingface.co/spaces 探索 AI 应用目录，利用视频生成、网页搜索、图像编辑以及成千上万的其他应用构建精彩项目。拥有 Pro 账户，你可以获得更高的使用限额以及更多权益。欢迎在下方评论区告诉我们你的发现和创作！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
